    <string name="help_title">POMODORO FOCUS TIMER &amp; WORK TRACKER</string>
    <string name="help_sec1_title">1. THE 4-POMODORO CYCLE</string>
    <string name="help_sec1_body">• Focus without interruption for 1 Pomodoro (default 25m).\n• Take a Short Break (5m) to relax and recharge.\n• Every 4 completed Focus sessions, take a Long Break (15m).</string>
    <string name="help_sec2_title">2. TOUCH &amp; KEYBOARD / D-PAD CONTROLS</string>
    <string name="help_sec2_body">• Tap Center Dial / START button (or SPACE / ENTER): Start or Pause.\n• Tap -5m / -1m / +1m / +5m (or UP / DOWN arrows): Adjust phase duration.\n• Tap Presets (or P key): Cycle Classic, Deep Work, Studio, and Sprint.\n• Tap Ambient Soundscapes (or M key): Toggle Soft Tick, Rain, or Brown Noise.\n• Tap SKIP &gt;&gt; (or N key) to jump phases; RESET (or R key) to rewind.</string>
    <string name="help_sec3_title">3. AUTOMATIC WORK-HOURS TELEMETRY</string>
    <string name="help_sec3_body">• Every second spent in an active Focus Session is logged to Today &amp; All-Time totals automatically.</string>
</resources>
